 r←Test_Cleanup_25(debugFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;T2;rc;log;expected
⍝ Exercise `Run` with a `Cleanup` function for a specific group that crashes (⍵ required, no result)
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 #.⎕SHADOW'Temp'
 'Temp'#.⎕NS''
 T2←⎕NEW ##.Tester2 #.Temp
 #.Temp.⎕FX'r←Test_Foo_01 x;⎕TRAP' 'r←0'
 #.Temp.⎕FX'Cleanup_Foo ps' '∘∘∘'
 (rc log)←T2.Run 1
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 expected←'Looking for a group function "Cleanup_Foo":  found but crashed (SYNTAX ERROR)'
 →T.PassesIf∨/expected⍷∊log

 r←T._OK
